      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "イアペトス大洞窟の中に発生している\n炎を消火してほしいのです。僕が思うに、\n炎の前でフィンブルの夜の魔法を使えば\n十分に対処可能なはずなのですが。",
        "official_en": "I'd like you to put out the flames in the Iapetus\nCavern. If you cast the Fimbulvetr Night spell on\nthem, that should do the trick.",
        "real_en": "I'd like you to put out the flames in the Iapetus\nCavern. If you cast the Night of Fimbul spell on\nthem, that should do the trick."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
